    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Bar Brawler",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The barkeep has been in enough bar fights to know how to throw a few punches. When fighting in their bar and making a nonlethal attack, the barkeep gains a +1 circumstance bonus to attack rolls and deals an additional 1d4 damage.",
